nd his best friend, Jack Sprat, look for treasure underground, they find an odd kingdom.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gMHjzccH1lHeU6SlCNwPgVCYmIp.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2015-12-11\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Mermaid\",\"overview\":\"To prove he is a ladies' hero, Puss saves a mermaid from a thief who quickly falls in love with him … and becomes a big problem.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nY3z8y2yRq5BF60ZeMBRlgadHPi.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2015-12-11\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Bees\",\"overview\":\"Puss gets scared when angry bees invade the town, so he calls on the Piper, who has helpful powers.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/65GdCRXZXrlwZwunonX7Do3AvQC.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2015-12-11\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Squad\",\"overview\":\"While Puss trains the orphans to work as a team to protect San Lorenzo, a villain comes to town and kidnaps him.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iSZcOm5qRptOMo4IzCZDtzGm15o.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2015-12-11\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Spells\",\"overview\":\"Puss tries to bring back the magic spell that protects the town. But he makes a mistake, and wacky things happen in a shop.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9XfH56uh2owUxps9o0ba8naG42y.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2015-12-11\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Scimitar\",\"overview\":\"While Puss looks for items missing from the treasure house, he gets help from the Scimitar, an evil sword.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8w8Q7IQDskzd8YUN49l3nAGy6XH.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2015-12-11\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Stories\",\"overview\":\"An angry thunder god demands to be let into the treasure house -- or he will destroy San Lorenzo!\",\"still\":\"https:/